    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502340/extras/d2bc08b7d3101d58be48e6285d1a9069.webp?t=1753799434\" width=617 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Torn Veil</i> is a first-person psychological horror game that plunges you into a chilling narrative of scientific ambition, moral decay, and the terrifying consequences of playing god. <i>Torn Veil</i> combines stunning visuals, immersive sound design, and a deeply unsettling atmosphere to deliver an unforgettable horror experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502340/extras/b966fb2619cc3b19642d1d248bbad15d.webp?t=1753799434\" width=617 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a dense forest, drawn to a mysterious twin house that feels hauntingly familiar. As you step inside, you\u2019re greeted by an eerie advertisement on a flickering TV:<br><i>\u201cWelcome to the future of existence. Your soul is more than a vessel\u2014it\u2019s a resource. Expand your existence. Join the waitlist today. But remember\u2026 there\u2019s no turning back.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house is a labyrinth of secrets, each room hiding clues to the dark experiments that took place here. Explore the decaying interiors, solve intricate puzzles, and uncover the truth behind the <i>Torn Veil</i> project\u2014a groundbreaking but horrifying attempt to harness the power of the human soul.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502340/extras/c79931e19a0c51c89ef7a7a2755acc28.webp?t=1753799434\" width=617 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you delve deeper into the basement, you\u2019ll encounter the remnants of the scientists\u2019 experiments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Crooked Soul</strong>: A malevolent entity born from a failed soul transfer, now stalking the halls and feeding on the living.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weeping Angels</strong>: Statues that come to life when you look away. Keep your eyes on them\u2014or face a gruesome end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Maze</strong>: A sprawling, ever-shifting labyrinth filled with traps, puzzles, and the lingering echoes of lost souls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with only a shotgun and your wits, you must survive the horrors of the basement, confront the Crooked Soul, and escape before your soul becomes the next experiment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502340/extras/bfef0d9e5333d065984f96a74d081f55.webp?t=1753799434\" width=617 height=57 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror</strong>: Experience a deeply atmospheric world brought to life with Unreal Engine 5\u2019s cutting-edge graphics, including realistic lighting, shadows, and environmental details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Terror</strong>: Face unnerving enemies, solve mind-bending puzzles, and navigate a narrative that blurs the line between reality and nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong>: From tense exploration to heart-pounding chases and brutal combat, <i>Torn Veil</i> keeps you on the edge of your seat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Storytelling</strong>: Uncover the tragic tale of the scientists and their families through environmental storytelling, cryptic notes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502340/extras/0392cb5469caa4b65eefd74c8d574635.webp?t=1753799434\" width=617 height=57 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <i>Torn Veil</i> and experience a horror game that will leave you questioning the very nature of existence. Are you ready to face the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now and prepare to uncover the secrets of the <i>Torn Veil</i>. Your support as an indie developer means everything\u2014thank you for being part of this journey.</p>",
